sequenceDiagram
 actor Passenger
 participant UI as TVM UI
 participant S as Payment Service
 participant G as Gateway
 participant DB as Order DB
 Passenger->>UI: Select QR payment
 UI->>S: Initiate(order, amount, idempotency key)
 S->>DB: Save Pending order
 S->>G: Create payment request
 G-->>S: QR payload, provider reference, expiry
 S-->>UI: Display QR and countdown
 Passenger->>G: Scan and authorize in wallet
 G->>S: Signed payment callback
 S->>S: Verify signature, amount, order, replay/idempotency
 S->>DB: Persist final status
 S-->>G: Acknowledge callback
 S-->>UI: Notify Paid or Failed
 Note over S,DB: Unknown outcome stays pending and is reconciled